Sure! Here’s a quick demo of how you can use the `todo` function:

```json
{
  "name": "todo",
  "arguments": {
    "type": "add",
    "content": "Buy groceries"
  }
}
```

This call will add a new task “Buy groceries” to your todo list. If you’d like to see examples for deleting or completing a task, just let me know!
